## Example Solutions



Example solutions are provided on web lab levels throughout the unit in the **teacher panel**. You can access these solutions when you are logged into your teacher account and have assigned the lesson to your class. This feature is not available in the professional learning, but is available once you are back in teacher mode. 

<details style="background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;">
    <summary style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;">🧑‍🏫 Teacher Panel</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px;">
    
