</details>

<div style="background-color:#B7E0E5;border-radius:40px;color:#000000;width:95%;padding:18px 24px;margin:24px 0;">

<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;">
<strong>💡 Teacher Tip:</strong> Take time to explore the lesson resources before teaching. Practice in Web Lab, preview student activities, and anticipate where students may struggle so you can support them more confidently during class.
